              <span class="dot">·</span>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rabiahkhanum2049/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
              <span class="dot">·</span>
              <span>Islamabad, Pakistan</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </header>

        <div class="cv-body">

          <!-- Profile -->
          <section class="cv-section">
            <h2 class="cv-section-title">Profile</h2>
            <p class="cv-prose">
              Electrical Engineer turned Documentation Engineer specialising in docs-as-code workflows, automation, and AI-ready documentation for SaaS and cloud companies. Built Python pipelines cutting build time from 2 days to minutes, managed 2 simultaneous client accounts, and conducted primary research with 70+ technical writers across the US and Europe. Currently advancing API documentation expertise through Postman's API Documentation Path.
            </p>
          </section>

