              <ul class="cv-bullets">
                <li>Engineered a Python Docs-as-Code pipeline using an open-source Python library (rstdoc) and GitHub Actions, cutting build time from <strong>hrs to minutes</strong> and eliminating manual RST file creation across the full content lifecycle</li>
                <li>Built live interactive features inside client documentation: a Python feedback button routing reader input to Jira via Slack webhooks, and a JavaScript/CSS copy-link button embedded in RST troubleshooting tables for instant cross-team alert sharing</li>
                <li>Restructured documentation for AI chatbot readability by implementing metadata layers, structured summaries, and conclusion sections; independently researched Neo4j knowledge graphs and Sphinx meta directives for stronger information retrieval</li>
                <li>Customised client-facing Sphinx themes using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, delivering branded developer portals aligned to client standards</li>
                <li>Managed documentation across <strong>2</strong> simultaneous client accounts — cloud networking and data analytics — within weekly sprint cycles and zero-error-margin standards</li>
