                <li>Built automation workflows using Zapier, Apollo, Clay, and Apify: <strong>25+</strong> prospect research lists (200–5,000 contacts each), automated Slack/email notification pipelines, and campaign and audit documentation</li>
                <li>Conducted primary industry research via <strong>71</strong> survey responses and <strong>7</strong> video interviews with senior technical writers across the US and Europe on AI adoption in documentation</li>
                <li>Actively participated in the full SDLC: requirements gathering, sprint planning, release documentation, and post-release updates</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-header">
                <div>
                  <span class="cv-job-title">Technical Writer Intern</span>
                  <span class="cv-job-sep">·</span>
                  <a href="https://xgrid.co" target="_blank" class="cv-job-company">Xgrid.co</a>
                </div>
