              <ul class="cv-bullets">
                <li>Authored developer-facing documentation for a US-based cloud networking client using Sphinx, reStructuredText, and GitHub within a docs-as-code workflow, delivering iterative updates aligned with weekly engineering sprints</li>
                <li>Documented Cisco PoC tools and cEdge networking solutions, translating complex networking concepts including routing, switching, TCP/IP, and VPN configurations into clear, task-oriented technical content</li>
                <li>Managed direct client communication with a US-based cloud networking team across weekly sprint meetings, triaging open documentation tickets and realigning deliverables with real-time engineering changes</li>
                <li>Created architecture diagrams and process flowcharts using Draw.io to support technical documentation and stakeholder presentations</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-job">
              <div class="cv-job-header">
                <div>
                  <span class="cv-job-title">IP Core Intern</span>
                  <span class="cv-job-sep">·</span>
                  <span class="cv-job-company-plain">Pakistan Telecommunication Company Ltd.</span>
                </div>
                <span class="cv-job-date">July 2023 – Sep 2023</span>
              </div>
              <ul class="cv-bullets">
                <li>Gained hands-on experience with OSI model, TCP/IP stack, IPv4/IPv6, subnetting, and core ISP operations, building domain knowledge directly applicable to cloud networking documentation</li>
                <li>Designed and tested virtual network topologies and core services including DHCP, DNS, routing, and switching in lab environments</li>
                <li>Documented network workflows, configurations, and troubleshooting scenarios, developing the technical depth needed to write accurately for engineering audiences</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- Two-column: Education + Skills -->
          <div class="cv-two-col">

            <section class="cv-section">
              <h2 class="cv-section-title">Education</h2>

              <div class="cv-edu-item">
                <p class="cv-edu-degree">BSc. Electrical Engineering</p>
                <p class="cv-edu-school">University of Engineering & Technology Taxila, Pakistan</p>
                <p class="cv-edu-meta">Aug 2020 – July 2024 · CGPA: 3.31/4.00</p>
              </div>
              <div class="cv-edu-item">
