              </div>
              <div class="cv-edu-item">
                <p class="cv-edu-degree">Matriculation (Science)</p>
                <p class="cv-edu-school">Army Public School and College, Kharian Cantt</p>
                <p class="cv-edu-meta">2016 – 2018 · Grade: A (94.64%)</p>
